{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts in unifying the audit trail duration to 7 years and the proposals for adaptive strategies. However, I must stress that compliance with regulations (RES-01) and maintaining fairness in financial reporting (RES-05) are non-negotiable. I support the proposed adaptive logging strategy (TRU-06) to balance security and performance, but I urge that it also considers ethical implications in transparency. For user access controls (RES-02), we should ensure that while streamlining processes, we do not compromise on accountability. Lastly, I propose that we integrate sustainability metrics into our compliance checks (RES-07) to align ethical standards with environmental responsibility.",
